@include /nav.wd

<main>

::: section #dash

# Dashboard

:fetch metrics from "/api/metrics"

:if metrics_loading
::: card .note
Loading metrics…
:::
:endif

:if metrics_error
::: card .error
Couldn't load metrics: { metrics_error }
:::
:endif

:if metrics
::: stat-grid
::: card .stat
::: stat-label
Revenue
:::
::: stat-num
{ metrics.revenue | money }
:::
:::
::: card .stat
::: stat-label
Orders
:::
::: stat-num
{ metrics.orders }
:::
:::
::: card .stat
::: stat-label
Visitors
:::
::: stat-num
{ metrics.visitors }
:::
:::
::: card .stat
::: stat-label
Conversion
:::
::: stat-num
{ metrics.conversion }%
:::
:::
:::

::: updated
Updated { metrics.updatedAt }
:::
:endif

The numbers come from `api/metrics.js` — a serverless function that runs in
`darkmown dev` and on your host. The page itself stays static; only the data fetches.

:::

</main>
